Description: Vulkan-based D3D12 for Wine (ARM64EC)
 vkd3d-proton is a fork of vkd3d, a Vulkan-based implementation of
 D3D12, tuned for Proton/wine, built here as aarch64 (ARM64EC) and
 i386 Windows DLLs for use with the ARM64EC wine build.
 .
 The DLLs are registered through update-alternatives against wine's
 builtin d3d12/d3d12core (vkd3d priority 20, 5 when Vulkan is not
 usable at install time).
